This package combines original editorial guidance with writing rules
adapted from the Google developer documentation style guide:

    https://developers.google.com/style

That guide's page content is licensed under Creative Commons
Attribution 4.0 International:

    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Code samples in the original guide are Apache 2.0. This package
contains no Google code samples.

The adapted Google mechanics and word-list snapshot were built against
the live guide on 2026-08-17. The live guide is the authority for
disputed Google style. The package's purpose-aware framing, compression,
and silent-editing guidance are original and aren't presented as Google
guidance.
